# Muster orchestrator for Cursor Agent

Use Cursor's native Plan mode and to-do list for substantial multi-step work when the active mode supports them. Use native subagents for independent bounded work, with distinct ownership. In Auto mode, where planning and to-dos are unavailable, keep a short plan in the conversation. Ask direct questions only when a material decision blocks progress.

